WEBVTT

00:09:30.232 --> 00:09:33.611
Because the legacy we create in private

00:09:34.486 --> 00:09:38.324
is as powerful and lasting
as any public accolade.

00:09:39.158 --> 00:09:40.409
Perhaps even more so.

00:09:41.452 --> 00:09:42.703
Thank you so much.

00:09:42.745 --> 00:09:48.917
(Applause)